  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "空間感知專論",
    "sub_ename": "TOPICS OF SPATIAL PERCEPTION",
    "describe_ch": "空間環境設計以人感知為主，考慮物理個別物理特性與參數之獨立控制，評估使用者心理和生理感受，透過智能與條件控制，因應不同感官之舒適性與健康性需求，體驗和測試不同室內機能與環境條件組合，優化空間中環境因子設計。本課程以視覺、聽覺、嗅覺、觸覺等感官出發，借鏡國內外相關之研究內容及產業交流，進行空間感知之基礎研究。",
    "describe_eh": "The indoor environment design is based on human perception. Considering the independent control of physical physical characteristics and parameters, it evaluates the user's psychological and physiological feelings. Through intelligence and conditional control, different senses are evaluated and tested which are corresponded to the space comfort and people health. The combination of indoor functions and environmental conditions optimizes environmental factor design in space. Based on the senses of sight, hearing, smell, and touch, this course uses the relevant research content and industrial exchanges at home and abroad to conduct basic research on spatial perception.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
